SYM-2P library in Exo

Source: https://github.com/aska-digital/protean-sym2p
Commit: 2d93ed603e94ddd3e4ddcab4b1d5fc4227832a1b (2026-10-11 checkout, v1.0.0 line)
License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 ASKA Digital

Vendored files:
- v1.py from scripts/protean-sym2p/sym-validate.py (SYM-2P/1.0 JSON packets and objects).
- v2.py from scripts/protean-sym2p/sym2_parse.py, sym2-validate.py, sym2-render.py
  and sym2-migrate.py (SYM-2P/2.0 draft dense lines).

Changes: CLIs and module globals removed; `now`, `verify_hashes` and `roles` became
parameters; encode, decode, render and bus helpers added in __init__.py and bus.py; bus.py also
routes Exo-profile lines (string atoms, opcodes 100+) to exo.wire (docs/AGENT-WIRE.md).
Validation rules and the wire grammar are unchanged. Normative text: SPEC.md and
SPEC-V2-DRAFT.md in the source repo.

